{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本女星永野芽郁，擺脫去年的桃色醜聞後，積極復出幕出。</p><p>她為搏翻身，首度挑戰擔任監製並主演改編漫畫的串流新劇《朝日町的孃王》將於冬天播出，日前再公開更多演出卡士。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;曾鬧出撞車逃逸醜聞的28歲男星伊藤健</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.503427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:03:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:17:59.725316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"10078bbb38548ec8a0b4d504b1af1de7a7400b0e8180f92e0c467254b897f37f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}